# The my-lisp CLI sidecar (see tauri.conf.json's externalBin and
# scripts/build-repl-sidecar.sh): required to exist locally for
# `cargo build`/`cargo tauri dev` to even compile (Tauri validates
# externalBin paths in build.rs), but it's a per-platform binary built
# fresh from my-lisp's latest main, never committed.
src-tauri/binaries/

